The sources under src/main/java/com/github/serezhka/airplay and the tables in
src/main/resources are vendored from serezhka/java-airplay at commit 00e6e3c
(MIT, see LICENSE), via the airplay/ library of this repository, which merges
the protocol and server modules and adapts them to Android (NIO-only Netty,
Android 7 API replacements, no debug file watcher, mDNS skips loopback).

The receiver glue in src/main/java/io/bk/tv/airplay is ported from
app/src/main/java/com/fongmi/android/tv/airplay.
